#. the raw pressure and what the curve makes of it, the tilt (above), the line's width
#. and its ink (0 to 1) (1760 px at 34 px).
#: rust/src/pensettings.rs
#, c-format
msgid "pressure %.2f -> %.2f  %s  width %.2f mm  ink %.2f"
msgstr "nacisk %.2f do %.2f  %s  szerokość %.2f mm  tusz %.2f"

